{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/24104","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/24104/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/24104/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/24104/events","html_url":"https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/issues/24104","id":1666071464,"node_id":"I_kwDOBFIx285jTjuo","number":24104,"title":"Nested 500 page inside a page","user":{"login":"HesterG","id":17645053,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NjQ1MDUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17645053?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HesterG","html_url":"https://github.com/HesterG","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HesterG/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HesterG/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HesterG/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HesterG/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HesterG/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HesterG/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HesterG/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HesterG/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HesterG/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":472744938,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0NzI3NDQ5Mzg=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/labels/type/bug","name":"type/bug","color":"ee0701","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2023-04-13T09:37:15Z","updated_at":"2023-05-30T00:01:03Z","closed_at":"2023-04-14T05:19:12Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":"resolved","sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Description\r\n\r\nThe position of 500 error might be incorrect if an error occurs inside a nested template. In the example below, the error occurs in line 694 of [`comments.tmpl`](https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/blob/2b749af50508a28c7088e7d76132c27f96a45789/templates/repo/issue/view_content/comments.tmpl#L694), and this 500 error page was nested around this place where the error occurs.\r\n\r\nhttps://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17645053/231715112-e151b595-d5e2-4344-a059-64671e359d99.mov\r\n\r\nSteps to reproduce:\r\n\r\n1. Create a team under an organization with the following settings\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1126\" alt=\"截屏2023-04-13 17 27 11\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17645053/231716531-a31155d7-b55b-4ae8-a45d-a7cb71f6b892.png\">\r\n\r\n2. Open a pull request and assign the team as the reviewer.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"313\" alt=\"截屏2023-04-13 17 32 27\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17645053/231718166-4495b00a-d8ec-4973-9784-0cc5a8d1a4eb.png\">\r\n\r\n3. Delete this team.\r\n4. Go back to the pull request where this team was formerly assigned.\r\n\r\nAnd the following JS error occurs because when the 500 error page is nested, there will be two `head_script.tmpl` with `webcomponents.js` imported twice. This error will be fixed if 500 page is not nested. \r\n\r\n<img width=\"1218\" alt=\"截屏2023-04-13 17 47 40\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17645053/231722468-2c9c9ca2-d27f-47d1-81be-fed74fa7f0d4.png\">\r\n\r\n\r\n### Gitea Version\r\n\r\nlatest\r\n\r\n### Can you reproduce the bug on the Gitea demo site?\r\n\r\nNo\r\n\r\n### Log Gist\r\n\r\n_No response_\r\n\r\n### Screenshots\r\n\r\n_No response_\r\n\r\n### Git Version\r\n\r\n_No response_\r\n\r\n### Operating System\r\n\r\n_No response_\r\n\r\n### How are you running Gitea?\r\n\r\nOn macOS:\r\n```\r\nTAGS=\"bindata sqlite sqlite_unlock_notify\" make build\r\n./gitea\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Database\r\n\r\nNone","closed_by":{"login":"lunny","id":81045,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81045?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunny","html_url":"https://github.com/lunny","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunny/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunny/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunny/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunny/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunny/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunny/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunny/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunny/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunny/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/24104/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/24104/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}